      "content": "That's a much better direction. The \"microscopic fortress\" imagery works well for the staff.\n\nTo finish this section, I want to touch on the idea of how they \"lurk\" or stay hidden behind that armor. I want to explain that they aren't just sitting there; they are effectively \"scouting\" or waiting for a specific breach in the environment to strike. \n\nCould you expand on that specific moment of the transition? I'd like a description of how the \"armor\" is compromised and how they essentially \"infiltrate\" the food once they've successfully bypassed that protective shell. I want to emphasize how they've essentially tricked the kitchen into thinking the food is safe when they're actually just waiting for the right moment to multiply.",
